title Cassette notice on the list page (T6d): The sound card was unplugged replaces the hint line (landscape) or the top strip (narrow); the layout check passes while it shows
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_NOTICE "The sound card was unplugged"
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 400
expect text "The sound card was unplugged"
shot list-unplugged
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect text "RENAME"
expect noquit
